  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposal, due to the undersized internal floor area and undersized bedrooms of No. 61a Fullers Road, fails to provide an acceptable standard of accommodation for future occupants, contrary to Policy D6 of the London Plan 2021 and policies DM13 of the Council's Core Strategy 2012.",
    "The proposal would result in the unjustified loss of an existing larger family dwellinghouse for which there is an identified managed need within the Borough. In the absence of a robust, evidence-backed policy justification for the loss of this essential housing typology, the proposal fails to deliver an appropriate housing mix or safeguard essential family housing stock, contrary to Policy H1 of the London Plan (2021) and Policy DM14 of the Royal Borough of Kingston upon Thames Core Strategy (2012)."
  ],
